{"id":"title-tmdb-1623376","type":"MOVIE","category":"CINE","title":"ブルーロック","overview":"A secret training program is established by the Japan Football Union to scout the world’s greatest striker after several years of defeat for the national team. Three hundred high school players gather at a remote facility to compete in ruthless trials where only one will emerge as the world’s greatest and most egoistic striker. The price of failure is absolute: those eliminated are permanently banned from ever joining the National Team.","releaseDate":"2026-10-29","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EOuBxH8cqkVFdblOOduNsC0TuU.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/znXyQgqITDm8fJxcvmlRpKlw49T.jpg","genres":["Acción","Drama"],"originalLanguage":"ja","spokenLanguages":["Japanese"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/znXyQgqITDm8fJxcvmlRpKlw49T.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/hg8OIRzMhISKBWhEURJKS3BvDaH.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/c7BiQzuBY4D6LoTNQOXeph9YmuL.jpg","label":"Escena 03"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/pl1KXLMn0c6moWPLGzWIfwfemHr.jpg","label":"Escena 04"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/yAvvTT3oaWY8wFir4mCAgywVW6F.jpg","label":"Escena 05"}],"ratings":{"tmdb":9},"availability":{},"cast":[{"name":"Fumiya Takahashi","role":"Yoichi Isagi","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNdoFv1zPypM3nxR5T7LfpfKLZR.jpg","personTmdbId":2389740,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"櫻井海音","role":"Meguru Bachira","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuq8QAdCFe9dUvyQzdSNLswFtgX.jpg","personTmdbId":3132499,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"高橋恭平","role":"Hyoma Chigiri","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNLPcVMZZqB8BEPYOYBR0L1FKTZ.jpg","personTmdbId":2636410,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"綱啓永","role":"Mikage Reo","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pdirixI897dHILW6BiUqks8wSd.jpg","personTmdbId":2238822,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"野村康太",